title: The challenge is peaceful!
pid: 26667b48-4dcd-44a0-9e64-fe0642c719f7
body: |2-
  Building a web by recording and connecting thoughts as they come, can resemble meditation, or fishing, or birdwatching: You watch the idea approach, it flitters around, transforms into other ideas, but finally it hovers so close that you are able to put the idea into words. Once it is in words, the bird-idea has become a puzzle piece, to fit into the web at your leisure.
